@startuml Execution Flow with Directory Management
autonumber

participant "User\nCode" as User
participant "Scenario\n(Observable)" as Scenario
participant "Scenario\nWorkflowObserver" as ScenarioObs
participant "Discipline\n(Observable)" as Discipline
participant "DisciplineExecution\nWorkflowObserver" as DiscObs
participant "Directory\nManager" as DirMgr
participant "Observer\nTree" as Tree

User ->> Scenario: scenario.execute()
activate Scenario

Scenario ->> ScenarioObs: start(CallSpec for execute)
activate ScenarioObs

ScenarioObs ->> Tree: Register as root observer
Tree -->> ScenarioObs: OK (I'm root)

ScenarioObs ->> DirMgr: start_directory(observer, "{scenario}")
activate DirMgr

DirMgr ->> DirMgr: Create dir\nChange cwd\nStore path

DirMgr -->> ScenarioObs: OK

note over Scenario: Now in {scenario}/\nNested observations have\nScenarioObserver as parent

loop For each discipline in formulation
    Scenario ->> Discipline: discipline.execute()
    activate Discipline

    Discipline ->> DiscObs: start(CallSpec for execute)
    activate DiscObs

    DiscObs ->> Tree: Register with parent=ScenarioObserver
    Tree -->> DiscObs: OK (parent is scenario)

    DiscObs ->> DirMgr: start_directory(observer, "{discipline}_execution")
    activate DirMgr

    DirMgr ->> DirMgr: Create dir\nChange cwd\nStore path

    DirMgr -->> DiscObs: OK

    note over Discipline: Now in {scenario}/\n{discipline}_execution/

    Discipline ->> Discipline: _run()

    Discipline ->> DiscObs: end(CallSpec, returned_data)
    deactivate Discipline

    DiscObs ->> DirMgr: end_directory(observer)
    activate DirMgr

    DirMgr ->> DirMgr: Return to parent dir\n(cleanup applies to MDA/scenario only)

    DirMgr -->> DiscObs: OK

    DiscObs ->> Tree: Unregister observer
    Tree -->> DiscObs: OK

    DiscObs -->> Scenario: done
    deactivate DiscObs
end

Scenario ->> ScenarioObs: end(CallSpec, returned_data)
deactivate Scenario

ScenarioObs ->> DirMgr: end_directory(observer)

DirMgr ->> DirMgr: Write OptHistoryView plots\nApply cleanup policy\nReturn to original dir

DirMgr -->> ScenarioObs: OK

ScenarioObs ->> Tree: Unregister observer
Tree -->> ScenarioObs: OK

ScenarioObs -->> User: done
deactivate ScenarioObs

User ->> User: Results in {scenario}/

note over User
  Final directory structure:
  execution_root/
  ├── {scenario}/
  │   ├── discipline_1_execution/
  │   │   └── ...
  │   ├── discipline_2_execution/
  │   │   └── ...
  │   ├── opt_history.pdf  (if save_history_backup)
  │   └── ...
end note

@enduml
